  "skeleton": {
    "about": "Applied to typed Latin and to the canonical romanisation alike: lowercase a-z only; the longest `replace` key at each position (else `letters`, else the letter itself); a symbol equal to the one before it is dropped (doubled letters); every `dropBetweenConsonants` letter with a consonant on both sides is dropped; then a final vowel in `dropFinal` after a consonant is dropped.",
